#DESCRIPTION
Outflow field faces with the semi-implicit solver at a large time step: the vacuum magnetic field of the GEM Harris sheet (no particles) evolves between outflow y-faces with c*dt/dx = 7 and theta = 0.5 for 60 steps. The zero-gradient outflow condition is not energy conserving, but its energy gain is bounded; with zero ghost nodes in the GMRES operator instead of the zero-gradient ghosts, the field grows exponentially.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-3.610813               xMin  [Lx = 25.6 d_i]
3.610813                xMax
-1.805407               yMin  [Ly = 12.8 d_i]
1.805407                yMax
-0.5                    zMin
0.5                     zMax

#NCELL
16                      nCellX  [dx = 1.6 d_i]
8                       nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
8                       maxBlockSizeX
8                       maxBlockSizeY
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
T                       isPeriodicX
F                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

#FIELDBOXBOUNDARY
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi
outflow                 fieldBoxBoundaryLo
outflow                 fieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi

#PARTICLEBOXBOUNDARY
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi
reflect                 particleBoxBoundaryLo
reflect                 particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi

#FIELDSOLVER
implicit

#DISCRETIZATION
0.5                     theta
0.0                     ratioDivC2C

#DIVE
F                       doCorrectDivE

#PLASMA
2                       nSpecies
1.0                     mass  [ions]
1.0                     charge
0.04                    mass  [electrons]
-1.0                    charge

#UNIFORMSTATE
13.03188                rho [/cc]
0.0                     ux
0.0                     uy
0.0                     uz
40168                   T [K]
13.03188                rho [/cc]
0.0                     ux
0.0                     uy
0.0                     uz
8033.6                  T [K]
0.0                     bx
0.0                     by
0.0                     bz
0.0                     ex
0.0                     ey
0.0                     ez

#PARTICLES
0                       nParticlePerCellX   vacuum
0                       nParticlePerCellY
1                       nParticlePerCellZ

#TESTCASE
gem

#GEMIC
1.0                     b0
0.5                     tp
0.14105                 lambda0  [0.5 d_i]
0.02821                 apert  [psi_0 = 0.1 B_0 d_i]
T                       useStandardGem
F                       useUniformPressure
F                       useUniformIonPressure
0.2                     nb
standard                pertType

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI
1.0e5                   uNormSI

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
3.159461668             dt  [c*dt/dx = 7]

#MONITOR
10                      dnReport

#SAVELOG
1                       dnSavePic
100000                  dnSavePT

#STOP
60                      MaxIter
-1.0                    TimeMax
